<title>USA: Group cuts stake in CACI International.</title>
<headline>Group cuts stake in CACI International.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Parsow Partnership Ltd said Wednesday it cut its stake in CACI International to 7.53 percent or 766,000 Class A common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Parsow said it sold 111,200 shares during September at prices ranging from $16.575 to $18.575 per share.</p>
<p>As of March 31 CACI reported an outstanding 10,170,000 Class A common shares.</p>
